# Made Clear Studios

> Made Clear Studios is an award-winning cardiology and MedTech content agency based in Oxford, UK, working across Europe and the United States. It plans, creates, films and distributes content for medical device and cardiology companies: KOL video interviews, on-site congress filming, medical documentaries, mechanism of action animation, VR medical education and live case broadcasts. Its work has been recognised by The Rx Club awards. Clients include Abbott, Philips, Medtronic, Shockwave Medical (Johnson & Johnson), iVascular and Egg Medical.

Contact: hello@madeclearstudios.com, +44 (0) 1865 965389, {{ siteUrl }}/contact

